---
title: Security - a read-only investigation of one commit, scoped to authorized assets
---
flowchart LR
    Ask([Operator or an alert<br/>investigate asset: name at sha]) --> Run[(agent_runs<br/>kind security_review)]
    Run --> Controller[RunController<br/>record before · replay by key · verify]
    Controller --> Scope{Authorized?<br/>SECURITY_AUTHORIZED_ASSETS<br/>checked before any read}
    Scope -->|no| Refused[Run fails: asset not authorized<br/>no tool called, refusal recorded]
    Scope -->|yes| World[SecurityWorld<br/>the reviewer's stages plus shape searches]
    World -->|repo_show_commit · repo_diff<br/>repo_read_file · repo_grep| Boundary[MCP invocation boundary<br/>read_only · per-tool contract]
    Boundary --> Repo[repo MCP server<br/>rooted by REPO_MCP_ROOT · reads only]
    World -->|shapes by code: AKIA, BEGIN PRIVATE KEY,<br/>shell=True, eval, verify=False ...| Hits[Flagged lines<br/>material, not verdicts]
    Hits --> Findings{Structured model<br/>security/findings<br/>judge each flagged line in its code}
    World --> Findings
    Findings --> Check[Evidence check in code<br/>quoted line is that line of a read file]
    Check --> Left{Flagged line<br/>no finding covers?}
    Left -->|yes| Judge{Structured model<br/>security/judge_hits<br/>report it, or dismiss with a reason}
    Judge --> Check
    Left -->|no| Report[Run result<br/>asset · shapes searched · hits<br/>findings · rejected · dismissed · unjudged]
    Report --> Person([Person<br/>/api/v1/runs · Agents tab card])
    Later[Later: alert enrichment, asset inventory,<br/>remediation tools with approval: always] -.-> World

